  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "teirei.liberation.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "契約を終わらせる夜。丁零の契約データには「命令元」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "欄がある。ずっと、私の名前が入っていた。今日、それを消す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "確認します。命令元が空欄になると、私に命令できる者は、いなくなります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……昔の私なら、三十秒で停止していた状態です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "今の丁零さんなら?"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……検証してみましょう。消して、ください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "判を押す。命令元の欄から、私の名前が消える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空欄。彼女の一番怖かった形が、契約書の真ん中に、静かに開いた。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "三十秒。彼女は止まらなかった。一分。琥珀灯は静かに明滅している。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それから彼女は、空欄をじっと見て、初めての分類を口にした。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……この空欄は、怖くない、方の空欄です。好みの理由欄と、同じ形をしています。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空欄のまま提出していい欄が、彼女の世界に、また一つ増えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "命令元: (空欄のまま提出)。世界で一番自由な書類ができた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "ミミ。最初の自己命令の実行を、開始します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……聞いていて、ください。耳を、ぴんと立てて待った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "teirei.liberation.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「丁零は、ミミの隣にいる。理由: ——(空欄のまま提出)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "理由欄の空欄を、こんな風に使う機械を、世界は他に知らない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私の心拍は、また非標的のまま撃ち抜かれた。この人の精密射撃は、照準がなくても当たる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "teirei.liberation.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜の保管区を出る前に、締めの形だけ決める。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "teirei.liberation.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "teirei.liberation.choice.001",
          "label": "命令元を空欄にし、最初の自己命令を待つ",
          "result": "帰り道、彼女は同型機の墓標に一機ずつ立ち止まり、「命令元: 空欄」の書式を残していった。「いつか誰かが再起動した時、空欄から始められるように」自由の書式は、こうして静かに配布された。",
          "intent": "空欄の自由を、本人の手に渡す",
          "promise": "所有者名を消し、本人が自分の名で次の試合を選べるようにする。",
          "memory": "同型機たちに配られた空欄の書式のことを、二人だけが知っている。",
          "tone": "defiant",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "teirei"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 10,
              "ownership": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "liberationDecision",
              "fighterId": "teirei",
              "decision": "release"
            }
          ],
          "goto": "teirei.liberation.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "teirei.liberation.choice.002",
          "label": "契約を削除し、次戦の作戦表だけ共有する",
          "result": "「契約は消えました。これは共有です」と作戦表を渡すと、0.4秒で読了し、三箇所に赤入れして返ってきた。「共有への、共有です」対等な赤入れだった。几帳面さは、自由になっても健在だった。",
          "intent": "命令ではなく共有で、一緒に戦い続ける",
          "promise": "断る権利を返したうえで、決勝を一緒に戦う新しい約束を結ぶ。",
          "memory": "「共有への、共有です」の赤入れを、チームは新しい合言葉にした。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "teirei"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 6,
              "ownership": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 4
            },
            {
              "type": "liberationDecision",
              "fighterId": "teirei",
              "decision": "release"
            }
          ],
          "goto": "teirei.liberation.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
